{"source_file": "products/services/catalogue-qa-digital-checkout/raw/store-activation.html", "sha256": "d102facab7ecb1ca3cc58210b05f84d69618639d8289bab66c08b034873fc7a4", "candidate_passages": ["Getting paidFeesSupported countriesProhibited productsActivate your storeVerify your identityTwo-factor authentication (2FA)Test modeStatement descriptorTax Forms", "Getting startedAdding affiliatesGetting referralsManaging affiliatesCreativesPayoutsThe affiliate experienceMerchant Affiliate FeesAffiliates", "Becoming an affiliateThe Affiliate HubGenerating referralsPayoutsFeesEmail", "Getting approvedBroadcastsSubscribersSegmentsEmail editorReportsSending limitsImporting subscribersSignup formsExporting subscribersDomains", "When you first sign up for Lemon Squeezy, your store will be in test mode. Before selling any products, you will need to enable live mode for your store. You can do this by clicking the “Activate your store” button in the sidebar.", "Fill in a short questionnaire about your business and customers", "Verify your identity", "Once submitted, approvals typically happen in 2-3 business days. We recommend you answer the questions honestly and provide as much information as possible.", "When you create products in test mode, they will not automatically be available in live mode when your store is activated. However, it’s easy to copy test mode products and discounts to live mode using the “Copy to Live Mode” item in the product or discount menu.", "Lemon Squeezy takes care of all those headaches for you as the merchant of record. For this reason, Lemon Squeezy reviews every store to run KYC & KYB checks to ensure the validity of your business and that the products you’re selling are aligned with our terms & acceptable use policies.", "What types of stores do you approve?", "We approve most stores selling digital goods that can be fulfilled by Lemon Squeezy (e.g. eBooks, PDFs, design assets, photos, audio, video, etc.) as long as they are not prohibited."]}
{"source_file": "products/services/catalogue-qa-digital-checkout/raw/prohibited-products.html", "sha256": "2f7f43d1c0835a346e78f317fa3c9f378bf14c381658f29404047b6ccc013fe1", "candidate_passages": ["As a general rule, we allow selling of digital goods that can be fulfilled through Lemon Squeezy’s website.", "The following products and services are prohibited on Lemon Squeezy:", "Services of any kind (including marketing, design, web development, consulting or other related services)", "IPTV services", "Products or content for which you do not hold a proper license or intellectual property rights", "Marketplaces - where you use your Lemon Squeezy store to “partner” to sell others’ products", "Private Label Rights (PLR) products or Master Resell Products (MRR) products - this includes any product which you’ve obtained a license to sell but do not hold the original IP rights", "Regulated services such as: real estate, mortgage, lending, telemarketing, cellular/communication, door-to-door sales, bankruptcy, legal, merchant, debt-relief, collections, banking/financing, currency exchange, warranties, etc."]}
{"source_file": "products/services/catalogue-qa-digital-checkout/raw/fees.html", "sha256": "0540d2bcc7b0cf4d9a8d400641bfa80588e58f893e18b9dd803a3d8a5879af60", "candidate_passages": ["Adding productsSharing productsVariantsPricing modelsUsage-based billingTax categoriesSingle paymentSubscriptionsLead magnetsPay what you wantFree trialsManaging file versionsLink variablesOrders", "Refund orderResend receiptGenerate invoiceExporting ordersCreating discount codesPayPal subscriptionsCheckout", "Getting startedAdding affiliatesGetting referralsManaging affiliatesCreativesPayoutsThe affiliate experienceMerchant Affiliate FeesAffiliates", "Becoming an affiliateThe Affiliate HubGenerating referralsPayoutsFeesEmail", "AboutGenerating license keysLicense keys and subscriptionsLemon.js", "+1.5% for international (outside of the US) transactions", "+1.5% for PayPal transactions", "+0.5% for subscription payments", "Platform fee ($0.50 + 5% of total + 1.5% int’l payment)$2.06", "Payout fees", "Lemon Squeezy will always try to minimize any fees associated with payouts. However, in some cases we will deduct a small fee from your payout total to cover processing and conversion fees. The actual fee varies depending on your payout method, region and settlement currency.", "Payouts via Stripe"]}
{"source_file": "products/services/catalogue-qa-digital-checkout/raw/supported-countries.html", "sha256": "dc492e4aec24a08097a9906eaf43328f3c1c4aafb80d0db0c24ed47501ed3c0f", "candidate_passages": ["Refund orderResend receiptGenerate invoiceExporting ordersCreating discount codesPayPal subscriptionsCheckout", "Getting startedAdding affiliatesGetting referralsManaging affiliatesCreativesPayoutsThe affiliate experienceMerchant Affiliate FeesAffiliates", "Becoming an affiliateThe Affiliate HubGenerating referralsPayoutsFeesEmail", "Lemon Squeezy supports merchants and affiliates in hundreds of countries. Find out if your country is supported for payouts and purchases.", "Lemon Squeezy can offer services to merchants and affiliates who can receive bank or PayPal payouts in one of the hundreds of countries we support.", "If you don’t see your country listed by PayPal or in the list below, sorry, you won’t be able to use Lemon Squeezy at this time (either as a merchant or an affiliate).", "PayPal payouts are supported in 200+ countries and regions.", "Bank payouts supported in the following countries:", "Canada", "(*) From May 2024, Stripe only accepts new accounts from India on an invite-only basis. This means merchants will only be able to set up a bank payout method if their accounts are pre-approved by Stripe. If you are a merchant from India without an approved Stripe account, you will have to use PayPal for payouts. See this Stripe doc for more info."]}
